  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "中日韓人文領域之應用",
    "sub_ename": "APPLICATION IN THE HUMANITIES OF CHINA, JAPAN, AND KOREA",
    "describe_ch": "為因應21世紀全球國際化的趨勢，及天涯若比鄰的時代，語文能力的溝通是基本的素養，是以與中日韓相關之人文領域(文化、文學、文字、藝術、風俗民情等)作普通精要之介紹，俾使學生往多元之方向發展，開拓視野，甚至以第二專長，具備未來競爭與謀生之能力。\r\n一、藉由認識、分析、鑑賞、知己知彼。\r\n二、協助瞭解、傳承、創新、開拓視野。\r\n",
    "describe_eh": "To respond to the trend of globalization in the 21st country and the era of the global village. Communication by using language skills is basic literacy, It is based on the humanities (culture, literature, writing, art, customs, etc.) related to China, Japan, and  Korea. The introduction of general essentials will enable students to develop in a diversified direction, open up their horizons, and build second expertise which provides the ability to compete and earn a lining in the future.",
